        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join us for the 10th Annual Music for Mental Health—an unforgettable night of live music, community, and purpose. Presented by Sir John Franklin High School, this milestone event brings together an incredible lineup of local talent: Performances by: 🎟️ Tickets: $35 All proceeds will be donated to the Canadian Cancer Society, supporting an important cause...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
